<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-INDIA 410 ALL OUT V SOUTH AFRICA IN FINAL TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA 410 ALL OUT V SOUTH AFRICA IN FINAL TEST.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>India were all out for 410 on the second day of the third and final test against South Africa at the Wanderers on Friday.</p>
</text>
